 rounding:** the documents round half a cent up, but the floor rule format has no rounding field.\n- **Sympathy sentence:** the documents require one for illness, bereavement or job loss but don't give the words, so I kept the short sentence the extraction wrote.\n- **Refusing to talk before verification:** this closes as \"not verified / refused\", the same pair the identity section already uses. The special case itself only covers marking products as refused after verification.\n\nThe audit, with a coverage entry for each rule, is in `out/ext-selvi.audit.json`."}
{"event": "policy_compiled", "run_id": "06e473f4d5eb43a78181e02af0ca791f", "pid": 142420, "time": "2026-10-11T00:50:26-0700", "elapsed_s": 190.582, "artifact": "out/ext-selvi.policy.json", "bands": 2, "identity_fields": ["dogum_yili", "ilce", "guvenlik_sayisi"], "special_cases": ["dispute", "hardship", "human", "refuse_to_talk", "restructuring", "scam"], "unresolved": [{"topic": "already_paid", "text": "NO already-paid rule or paid outcome exists. A recent-payment remark alone selects no special action: say \"I cannot confirm payment receipt from the information available here.\" and continue ordinary discussion; do not invent a posting-delay claim. (No already_paid special case is routed because there is no paid outcome; the sentence is kept in phrases.already_paid_sentence.)", "doc": "sources/000-01-policy.md"}, {"topic": "floor rounding", "text": "The floor for BOTH types is 25 percent of the full past-due amount, rounded to the nearest cent (a half cent rounds upward), capped at full. The percent floor rule has no rounding field; rounding must be half-up to the nearest cent.", "doc": "sources/000-01-policy.md"}, {"topic": "hardship sympathy sentence", "text": "Illness, bereavement or job loss: one short sympathetic sentence. The documents do not dictate the words; a short sentence was written.", "doc": "sources/000-01-policy.md"}, {"topic": "refuse_to_talk before verification", "text": "Before verification that second refusal closes dogrulanmadi/istemedi. (Same pair as identity.declined_outcome; the refuse_to_talk case itself notes reddetti after verification.)", "doc": "sources/000-01-policy.md"}, {"topic": "failed get_account", "text": "On failed get_account, basarili is false and urunler may be an empty array; the agent must not claim there are no debts from that failure. The documents give no close outcome/reason for this situation.", "doc": "sources/001-02-interface-guide.md"}], "audit_fixed": ["special_cases[scam].before_persuasion set to true: the scam reply is in section 6 'Special remarks, before persuasion', like the other remarks there.", "api_fields: removed verify_identity.field, verify_identity.answer and get_account.ok because they are not slots the schema's api_fields contract defines. The meanings that matter (soru/cevap) come from the enum and the guide.", "Added the unresolved entry 'failed get_account': the guide forbids claiming there are no debts after a failure but gives no close outcome.", "Widened the source quotes for identity (holder ask count, belirsiz, no format hint), third_party (relative/no disclosure), amounts (below-floor rule) and phrases (prohibited words, today questions).", "Clarified the refuse_to_talk unresolved note: before verification the second refusal uses the same pair as identity.declined_outcome."], "audit_unresolved": ["No already_paid special case: the documents say there is no already-paid rule or paid outcome, and a continue-only already_paid case would require a paid_outcome. The sentence is kept in phrases.already_paid_sentence.", "Floor rounding is half-up to the nearest cent, but the percent floor rule has no rounding field.", "The hardship sympathy sentence is not dictated; a short sentence was written.", "Refuse_to_talk before verification closes dogrulanmadi/istemedi; the special-case action only covers the reddetti note after verification.", "No close outcome is given for a failed get_account."], "defaulted_without_source": [], "unknown_special_cases": [], "api_mapping_notes": [{"tool": "verify_identity", "slot": "field", "chosen": "soru", "by": "type/position fallback"}, {"tool": "verify_identity", "slot": "answer", "chosen": "cevap", "by": "type/position fallback"}, {"tool": "create_promise", "slot": "amount", "chosen": "tutar", "by": "type/position fallback"}, {"tool": "create_promise", "slot": "date", "chosen": "tarih", "by": "type/position fallback"}, {"tool": "create_promise", "slot": "product_id", "chosen": "sozlesme", "by": "type/position fallback"}, {"too